            booksHowPicked:"How we picked them", booksHowPickedP1:"We did not chase the year's loudest titles. Each book on this list passed three filters: <strong>timelessness</strong> (still useful a decade from now), <strong>action density</strong> (one idea per chapter you can use today), and <strong>re-readability</strong> (the kind of book that gives more on the third read than the first).",
            booksHowPickedP2:"If you only read three books from this list, start with <strong>Meditations</strong>, <strong>Atomic Habits</strong>, and <strong>Deep Work</strong>. They cover the inner life, the daily system, and the rare hour of focused work that changes a week. To see how we built the system behind these picks, read the full", booksAtomicGuideLink:"Atomic Habits ultimate guide", booksFieldReportLink:"4-read field report",
