            habitAffiliateHeading:"Affiliate Disclosure:", habitAffiliateText:"As an Amazon Associate, we earn from qualifying purchases made through the Amazon links on this page. The price you pay is unchanged. We only recommend books we've personally read and found genuinely valuable — never paid placements.", habitAffiliateLink:"Read our full disclosure policy →",
            habitWhyStack:"Why habit books stack", habitWhyStackP1:"These books are not interchangeable. Atomic Habits gives you the design framework. Can't Hurt Me gives you the accountability standard. The Discipline Daily gives you the daily execution layer. Read them in that order.", habitWhyStackP2:"If you want to test one habit before buying the books, read our", habitTwoMinLink:"2-Minute Rule guide", habit90DayLink:"90-day identity test", habitAtomicGuideLink:"Atomic Habits ultimate guide", habitBrowseFull:"Browse the full collection:", habitBestBooksLink:"best self-help books", habitBestFocusLink:"best focus books", habitBestStoicismLink:"best stoicism books",
