            quizKicker:"Free Tool · 2-Minute Quiz", quizTitle:"What's Your <em>Discipline Type?</em>", quizSubtitle:"5 questions. 4 archetypes. One custom protocol. Find out why most productivity advice fails you — and what to do instead.",
            quizProgress:"Question {n} of {total}", quizBack:"← Back", quizNext:"Next →", quizSeeMyType:"See My Type →",
            quizYourStrengths:"Your Strengths", quizYourBlindSpot:"Your Blind Spot", quizYourProtocol:"Your 30-Day Protocol",
            quizReadArticles:"Read Your Type's Articles →", quizRestart:"Take the Quiz Again",
            quizWhyWorks:"Why this quiz works", quizWhyP1:"Most productivity advice is generic. It tells you to \"wake up at 5 AM\" or \"do a 75 Hard\" — but if your archetype doesn't match the protocol, you'll fail. This quiz identifies your natural strength and gives you a system that fits <em>your</em> wiring — not someone else's.", quizWhyP2:"Built from patterns I observed coaching and studying 200+ people over 8 years. It's not clinical psychology, but it's accurate enough to give you a useful starting point.", quizWhyP3:"The four archetypes are not labels — they are starting points. You can move between them. The goal is not to box you in. The goal is to give you a protocol that respects how you actually work, not how you wish you worked.",
            quizFourArchetypes:"The Four Archetypes",
            quizBuilderName:"The Builder", quizBuilderDesc:"You compound small wins into unrecognisable lives. Daily consistency is your superpower. You trust the process even when nothing visible happens.", quizBuilderBlind:"You over-build and rarely launch. Your strength (foundation) can become your trap (never shipping).",
            quizSprinterName:"The Sprinter", quizSprinterDesc:"You do impossible things in 30 days. Then you reset. You execute under deadlines and thrive on intensity and novelty.", quizSprinterBlind:"The crash after the sprint. You lose momentum between cycles. Stack a Sprinter with a Builder ritual.",
            quizMarathonerName:"The Marathoner", quizMarathonerDesc:"You win by never quitting. Consistency is your religion. Identity shifts happen deep and last.", quizMarathonerBlind:"You can become so patient you forget to push intensity. Slow becomes stuck. Add a sharpening phase every quarter.",
            quizStrategistName:"The Strategist", quizStrategistDesc:"You build systems that compound while you sleep. You see the leverage others miss. Tools and automation are your edge.", quizStrategistBlind:"You optimize the system instead of doing the work. Strategy becomes procrastination. Block one \"no-strategy\" day per week.",
            quizHowToUse:"How to Use Your Result", quizHowP1:"<strong>Take the quiz.</strong> Answer all 5 questions honestly. There's no right or wrong answer — only what's true for you.", quizHowP2:"<strong>Read your archetype.</strong> Understand your strengths and blind spots. The protocol is your starting point, not your final destination.", quizHowP3:"<strong>Apply the 30-day protocol.</strong> Follow the custom plan for your type. Track starts, not finishes. The 2-day rule protects the streak.", quizHowP4:"<strong>Review after 30 days.</strong> Ask: did this fit? If yes, continue. If no, adjust. The goal is progress, not perfection.", quizHowP5:"<strong>Share your type.</strong> Send it to your accountability partner. Social commitment increases the odds of showing up by 2-3x.",
            quizFaqTitle:"FAQ", quizFaq1Q:"Is this quiz really free?", quizFaq1A:"Yes. 100% free. No signup required to see results. No credit card. No email required. Just answer 5 questions and get your archetype.", quizFaq2Q:"How accurate is it?", quizFaq2A:"Built on patterns from coaching 200+ people over 8 years. Not clinical, but useful. Think of it as a compass, not a map. It points you in the right direction — you still have to walk.", quizFaq3Q:"Will I get a custom plan?", quizFaq3A:"Yes. Each archetype comes with a custom 30-day protocol based on your type. The protocol is specific, actionable, and designed for your natural wiring.", quizFaq4Q:"Can my archetype change?", quizFaq4A:"Yes. Your archetype can shift based on context, season of life, and the habit you're building. A Sprinter in fitness can be a Marathoner in writing. Retake the quiz every 90 days.", quizFaq5Q:"What if I'm between two archetypes?", quizFaq5A:"That's normal. Most people have a primary and a secondary. Read both protocols. Blend what works. The goal is not to fit a box — it's to build a system that serves you.",
